OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky criticises 'gift to Putin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he has
OL,7,Freached an agreement with Russian
OL,8,FPresident Vladimir Putin allowing
OL,9,FMoscow to "immediately release" diesel
OL,10,Finto the global market.
OL,12,FHe said Putin had agreed to release
OL,13,F300,000 tonnes of diesel immediately,
OL,14,Ffollowed by 500,000 tonnes in November
OL,15,Fand another million after that.
OL,17,F"Diesel Prices for Americans and,
OL,18,Findeed, the World, will be COMING DOWN,
OL,19,FIN RECORD NUMBERS, AND FAST!" Trump
OL,20,Fwrote on Truth social.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
