OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky criticises 'gift to Putin'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn envoy to Putin welcomed the deal,
OL,7,Fbut Ukraine's president said any easing
OL,8,Fof sanctions on Russia played into
OL,9,FMoscow's hands and would prolong a war
OL,10,Fthat must be ended.
